WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.835
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night".

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:04.704
Thank you so much
for being with us tonight.

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:06.339
And now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:09.041
Saturday was President Biden's
79th birthday.

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:11.411
Democrats call it
a happy occasion.

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:12.545
And Republicans call it

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:16.182
proof that inflation
is out of control.

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.250
In a new interview,

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.918
Michigan Congresswoman
Rashida Tlaib

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:22.321
referred to Democratic Senators
Joe Manchin and Kyrsten Sinema

00:00:22.321 --> 00:00:24.791
as, quote, "corporate
Democrats." They're offended,

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:28.928
but just about
the Democrat part.

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:30.764
President Biden is set to speak
tomorrow

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:33.800
about his administration's
efforts to combat rising costs.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.269
So make sure to catch the speech
tomorrow

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:40.506
for just $69.95 on pay per view.

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:43.843
And the FBI reportedly searched
the site of a former landfill

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:46.011
In New Jersey last month,
looking for the body

00:00:46.011 --> 00:00:49.382
of union leader Jimmy Hoffa.
So far no Hoffa.

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:55.020
Three Jimmys,
but no Hoffa.

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:57.857
According to a new report,
U.S. domestic air travel

00:00:57.857 --> 00:01:00.293
has almost completely recovered
from the pandemic,

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.561
Not yet recovered?

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:05.331
Flight attendants.

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:07.434
After Kyle Rittenhouse
was found not guilty,

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:09.369
Republican Congressman
Madison Cawthorn,

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:10.836
Matt Gaetz,
and Paul Gosar

00:01:10.836 --> 00:01:13.472
each offered Rittenhouse
an internship, which is great.

00:01:13.472 --> 00:01:15.208
It's not jail time,
but it would be nice

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:20.746
if he got
some kind of punishment.

00:01:20.746 --> 00:01:23.082
The clothing brand Old Navy
on Friday

00:01:23.082 --> 00:01:25.017
launched a virtual
Santa Boot Camp

00:01:25.017 --> 00:01:27.052
to train mall Santas
on how to deal

00:01:27.052 --> 00:01:28.755
with outrageous
gift requests,

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:33.225
like gas.

00:01:33.225 --> 00:01:35.160
And finally, Apple announced
last week

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:37.530
it'll launch a new
self-service repair program

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.732
that will offer users tools
and parts

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:41.167
to fix their own devices.

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:46.439
Alright, but Trader Joe's
already does that.

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:47.941
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

